  "thinking": "Observed: bastion01 accepted the client key but refused forwarding to the next hop; its configuration set AllowTcpForwarding no. Enabling that directive addressed the demonstrated forwarding blocker while preserving other configuration. The next attempt reached app-cluster01 but failed authentication; server logs reported unsafe authorized_keys permissions, and metadata showed mode 0777 with the matching client key already present. Changing only the mode to 0600 fixed that issue without altering keys or disabling permission checks. The final standard connection ran hostname successfully and returned server4, which the client configuration identifies as app-cluster01. This supports the conclusion that connectivity is restored."
}

